e": 17}, {"w": "a", "t": 49.1, "d": 0.14, "line": 17}, {"w": "rock", "t": 49.24, "d": 0.26, "line": 17}, {"w": "You", "t": 49.94, "d": 0.08, "line": 18}, {"w": "see", "t": 50.02, "d": 0.22, "line": 18}, {"w": "Niihau", "t": 50.7, "d": 0.28, "line": 18}, {"w": "was", "t": 50.98, "d": 0.2, "line": 18}, {"w": "never", "t": 51.18, "d": 0.34, "line": 18}, {"w": "empty", "t": 51.52, "d": 0.34, "line": 18}, {"w": "It", "t": 52.12, "d": 0.1, "line": 18}, {"w": "was", "t": 52.22, "d": 0.12, "line": 18}, {"w": "private", "t": 52.34, "d": 0.38, "line": 18}, {"w": "one", "t": 52.98, "d": 0.2, "line": 18}, {"w": "family", "t": 53.18, "d": 0.26, "line": 18}, {"w": "no", "t": 53.76, "d": 0.24, "line": 18}, {"w": "phones", "t": 54.0, "d": 0.36, "line": 18}, {"w": "no", "t": 54.6, "d": 0.16, "line": 18}, {"w": "power", "t": 54.76, "d": 0.34, "line": 18}, {"w": "one", "t": 55.4, "d": 0.22, "line": 18}, {"w": "boat", "t": 55.62, "d": 0.16, "line": 18}, {"w": "a", "t": 55.78, "d": 0.1, "line": 18}, {"w": "week", "t": 55.88, "d": 0.18, "line": 18}, {"w": "The", "t": 56.24, "d": 0.16, "line": 19}, {"w": "rancher", "t": 56.4, "d": 0.28, "line": 19}, {"w": "got", "t": 56.68, "d": 0.14, "line": 19}, {"w": "a", "t": 56.82, "d": 0.12, "line": 19}, {"w": "medal", "t": 56.94, "d": 0.14, "line": 19}, {"w": "The", "t": 57.5, "d": 0.12, "line": 19}, {"w": "submarine", "t": 57.62, "d": 0.32, "line": 19}, {"w": "never", "t": 57.94, "d": 0.28, "line": 19}, {"w": "came", "t": 58.22, "d": 0.26, "line": 19}, {"w": "And", "t": 58.7, "d": 0.12, "line": 20}, {"w": "the", "t": 58.82, "d": 0.12, "line": 20}, {"w": "plane?", "t": 58.94, "d": 0.24, "line": 20}, {"w": "Still", "t": 59.18, "d": 0.58, "line": 20}, {"w": "in", "t": 59.76, "d": 0.12, "line": 20}, {"w": "a", "t": 59.88, "d": 0.08, "line": 20}, {"w": "Hawaii", "t": 59.96, "d": 0.24, "line": 20}, {"w": "museum", "t": 60.2, "d": 0.44, "line": 20}, {"w": "a", "t": 60.96, "d": 0.1, "line": 20}, {"w": "souvenir", "t": 61.06, "d": 0.44, "line": 20}, {"w": "from", "t": 61.5, "d": 0.12, "line": 20}, {"w": "the", "t": 61.62, "d": 0.1, "line": 20}, {"w": "island", "t": 61.72, "d": 0.26, "line": 20}, {"w": "that", "t": 61.98, "d": 0.16, "line": 20}, {"w": "was", "t": 62.14, "d": 0.12, "line": 20}, {"w": "supposed", "t": 62.26, "d": 0.34, "line": 20}, {"w": "to", "t": 62.6, "d": 0.24, "line": 20}, {"w": "be", "t": 62.84, "d": 0.1, "line": 20}, {"w": "empty", "t": 62.94, "d": 0.26, "line": 20}], "lines": [{"i": 0, "text": "A Pearl Harbor pilot was told to crash on an empty island.", "t0": 0.167, "t1": 3.217, "pauses_cut": 0}, {"i": 1, "text": "A hundred and thirty-six people were standing on it.", "t0": 3.3, "t1": 5.909, "pauses_cut": 0}, {"i": 2, "text": "The plan: land on tiny Niihau... and wait for a submarine.", "t0": 5.992, "t1": 9.63, "pauses_cut": 2}, {"i": 3, "text": "So he lands.", "t0": 9.713, "t1": 10.797, "pauses_cut": 0}, {"i": 4, "text": "In a fence.", "t0": 11.697, "t1": 12.546, "pauses_cut": 0}, {"i": 5, "text": "A local man pulls him out, and politely borrows his pistol and his papers.", "t0": 12.629, "t1": 16.295, "pauses_cut": 0}, {"i": 6, "text": "The pilot wants them back. No luck.", "t0": 16.378, "t1": 18.402, "pauses_cut": 1}, {"i": 7, "text": "Nobody here knows there's a war... so they throw him a party!", "t0": 18.485, "t1": 21.694, "pauses_cut": 0}, {"i": 8, "text": "That night, a battery radio delivers the news.", "t0": 21.944, "t1": 24.425, "pauses_cut": 1}, {"i": 9, "text": "The party ends quickly.", "t0": 24.508, "t1": 25.982, "pauses_cut": 0}, {"i": 10, "text": "Now he's a prisoner. And no boat can come: the military has banned them all.", "t0": 26.066, "t1": 29.723, "pauses_cut": 2}, {"i": 11, "text": "Five days later, he finds a helper... with a shotgun.", "t0": 29.973, "t1": 33.329, "pauses_cut": 2}, {"i": 12, "text": "They burn a house looking for the papers. They burn the plane.", "t0": 33.413, "t1": 36.388, "pauses_cut": 1}, {"i": 13, "text": "The village hides in caves. One rancher does not.", "t0": 36.471, "t1": 39.339, "pauses_cut": 1}, {"i": 14, "text": "He jumps the pilot. The pilot shoots him three times.", "t0": 39.422, "t1": 42.279, "pauses_cut": 1}, {"i": 15, "text": "As he told it later... that's when he got mad.", "t0": 42.363, "t1": 45.214, "pauses_cut": 1}, {"i": 16, "text": "He throws the pilot into a stone wall.", "t0": 45.297, "t1": 47.4, "pauses_cut": 0}, {"i": 17, "text": "His wife ends the argument with a rock.", "t0": 47.483, "t1": 49.688, "pauses_cut": 0}, {"i": 18, "text": "You see, Niihau was never empty. It was private: one family, no phones, no power, one boat a week.", "t0": 49.938, "t1": 56.182, "pauses_cut": 2}, {"i": 19, "text": "The rancher got a medal. The submarine never came.", "t0": 56.265, "t1": 58.625, "pauses_cut": 1}, {"i": 20, "text": "And the plane? Still in a Hawaii museum... a souvenir from the island that was supposed to be empty.", "t0": 58.708, "t1": 63.37, "pauses_cut": 2}]}